---
title: Secvența 2 – operatorul trimite SET_INTERVAL, iar device-ul confirmă
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OP as Operator
    participant CC as :CommandConsole
    participant B as :Broker MQTT
    participant CQ as commands :BlockingQueue
    participant APE as :AperiodicCommandTask
    participant PER as :PeriodicTelemetryTask
    participant MPS as :MessageProcessor (status)
    participant CSV as :CsvStorage
    participant DB as :Dashboard

    OP->>CC: "device-1 SET_INTERVAL 1000"
    CC->>CC: split → deviceId = "device-1",<br/>comanda = "SET_INTERVAL 1000"
    CC-)B: publish(.../device-1/commands, "SET_INTERVAL 1000")
    B-)CQ: put("SET_INTERVAL 1000")
    CQ-->>APE: take() → eliberarea unui job aperiodic
    APE->>APE: parse + validare (100 ≤ ms ≤ 60000)
    APE->>PER: setPeriodMs(1000)
    Note over PER: perioada nouă se aplică<br/>de la următoarea eliberare
    APE-)B: publish(.../device-1/status, "device-1#59;ts#59;OK SET_INTERVAL 1000")
    B-)MPS: "device-1#59;ts#59;OK SET_INTERVAL 1000"
    MPS->>CSV: append("status", mesaj)
    MPS->>DB: updateStatus("device-1", "OK SET_INTERVAL 1000")
    MPS-->>OP: afișare imediată: [status] device-1: OK SET_INTERVAL 1000
